    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
The routing flags RabbitFX&apos;s ``SetTextures`` sets on the SOURCE&apos;s own draw of each drawn component that keeps
RabbitFX (:cpp:member:`SourceComponent::rabbitFX`) and whose sections run ``SetTextures`` -- from what that
draw has BOUND at ``ps-t0`` .. ``ps-t3``, not from the maps the mod hands RabbitFX. Per register: the mod&apos;s own
line (unless only a toggle sets it), else the mod&apos;s ``this`` override of the game texture there, else the game
texture itself (:cpp:member:`SourceComponent::RabbitFX::gameTags`)
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>data</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The parser&apos;s data of the mod&apos;s <computeroutput>.ini</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>roles</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>What the roles resolve to (<ref refid="struct_a_g_remap_core_1_1_w_w_m_i_fixer_config_1a0e426d1d6de387f34992a769db6f1a2a" kindref="member">roleResources</ref>) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>toggled</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>(role, component) -&gt; what binds the role outside a toggle (:cpp:member:<computeroutput><ref refid="struct_a_g_remap_core_1_1_w_w_m_i_fixer_config_1_1_game_defaults_1a6c1ff79d2dc82a4166789473e88cce7c" kindref="member">GameDefaults::toggled</ref></computeroutput>) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>drawn</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Each source component the mod draws (reroutes included) -&gt; its sections </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>rerouteFrom</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>A reroute that took draws -&gt; the component it took them from </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>iniPath</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The mod&apos;s <computeroutput>.ini</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>iniFolder</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>.ini</computeroutput>&apos;s folder</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Component -&gt; its four flags (:cpp:func:<computeroutput><ref refid="class_a_g_remap_core_1_1_rabbit_f_x_1ac74c6108b22de6d1a3c049c3e1620adc" kindref="member">RabbitFX::routingFlags</ref></computeroutput>)<verbatim>embed:rst 
One line a linked ``.ini`` sets on this file&apos;s draws, as the fix carries it -- see #linkedLines
</verbatim> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
